{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/254948-20th-anniversary-werewolf-core-book-missing-pages","id":254948,"title":"20th Anniversary Werewolf Core Book Missing pages","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-11T19:36:58-07:00","id":254948,"title":"20th Anniversary Werewolf Core Book Missing pages","content":"Just got my Premium Color, Hardbound copy of Werewolf: the Apocalypse 20th anniversary edition delivered by UPS today. I was so excited. I hurriedly opened the package, removed the plastic air cushions and opened the book. Then I sadly noticed that the first 52 pages were missing. My heart sank. I paid $100 plus $15 shipping, only to receive a book missing a huge chunk of pages. I'm communicating with DrivethruRPG to get the issue resolved. I even sent some nice pics so they could see that the section was missing. Has this happened to anyone else. I imagine that Lightning Source probably has this happen a lot. But, ugh. They're supposed to be the best of the best when it comes to Print on Demand books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2910-gideonhelmsley","name":"GideonHelmsley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T22:49:46-07:00","id":255065,"title":"","content":"I've heard of printing errors with some other books here and there, but generally it's uncommon and I've never experienced it myself.<br /> <br /> I will say that generally DTRPG is solid on the support, in every instance of the slightest of problems I've had or heard about they very quickly sort it out in a quite satisfactory manner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T23:39:59-07:00","id":255086,"title":"","content":"Hey Odd_Canuck! Just checked my inbox before coming over here. They're going to send me another copy to make up for the missing pages. They are super fast with the response time to problems. Aside from another 2 to 3 week wait, I should have my complete copy soon. Here's hoping to sooner rather than later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2910-gideonhelmsley","name":"GideonHelmsley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}